  "_about": "a sulphur-crested cockatoo: stocky and white all over, the long sulphur-yellow crest raised and curving forward, a faint yellow wash on the cheeks and under the wings and tail; the heavy black hooked bill, a pale bare ring round the dark eye; grey zygodactyl feet (2026-11-08, review.py: bill) The bill: the parrot's two mandibles scaled onto this one's roots -- the upper's hook bent down to end a little below and before the lower's tip (it curled back into a C round a hole), the lower a deep scoop fitting into its curve (it was a block).",
